<p>Now, the timing of this sale might seem somewhat arbitrary. It’s a couple fun toys to play with outside during the summer. But there’s a reason we’re specifically selling it right now, the day before Father’s Day. Because this is the perfect belated Father’s Day gift to give yourself or the father figure in your life.</p>
<p>Why is it so ideal?</p>
<p>Two reasons.</p>
<p>First, there are two of them. That means dad and kid can play at the same time. Or, if there’s more than one kid, kid one and kid two can play while dad relaxes. Then, after bedtime, you’ve got a stunt car for each parent.</p>
<p>The second, less obvious one is hidden in that first one. It’s the relaxation element.</p>
<p>Kids in the 4-12 range have, in our experience, two modes:</p>
<ol>
<li>On the couch, watching TV, mesmerized to the point of being catatonic, totally unreachable.</li>
</ol>
<p>And…</p>
