</ol>
<p>As a dad, you want to limit how much time your kids spend parked in front of the TV and encourage them to get some fresh air. Without direction, however, they might suggest a version of tag that involves scaling trees, or some other activity not attuned to an adult’s stamina and back health.</p>
<p>Having a pair of fun stunt cars gives dad and the kids a chance to do something engaging and cooperative yet easy on the parental body.</p>
